  `ε₁/ε₂ ≡ −(y'/x')³⁷ (mod 𝔩)`, and `−1 = (−1)³⁷`, so `ε₁/ε₂` is a `37`-th power mod `𝔩`.

This is `caseII_lemma98LocalPower37_directResidue` (proven), the **clean** form of the Lemma-9.8
