engine is **exactly the pair of Lemma-9.6/9.7 hypotheses** (`x' ∉ lv149`, `z' ∈ lv149`) on the
descent data — *not* a §9.1 cyclotomic identification, *not* the obstructed `Q_η₀` producer, *not* a
